    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5130e94f2277690b26a81246",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "鲁道夫象征",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba58fa29016f4366679b31c483127417c7d74c51f8dbea2e0de6e4b65088d5e9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b93b0951e2e043df25d94991",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『不过――如果是能够实现这一成就的赛马娘，\n她自然会知道的吧』",
      "source_fingerprint": "edfa47fc8b928d571b6b31a36e8d264ad45ead7be85957afe6489fc2e3b95b63",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db8242d165604cf6e734e846",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "伟大的赛马娘如是说道。\n那么……能够实现这一成就的赛马娘会怎么说呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f215a423307e06025cb2ea126b33adc8de1900cf670ec6b842e4c634cca4d12",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1ec3dda784dc152dd665004",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『只要变得比任何人都强就行』？\n『比任何人都跑得更久』『受幸运的眷顾』？\n……我在心中描绘出各种答案，却又一一摇头。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6ce05f3883d9769149d0e535cccba4b3d8202a0e7524380507e491fd4a9b0f5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49c2602ec97827c373e9c8e5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――仿佛任何答案都不够贴切。\n而在某天，萦绕脑海某处困扰我许久的疑问……\n突然被一道鲜明又轻盈的光芒照亮。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd35e49e21cec3a11273547c810af63dfb11c49aaff03e68b88a5460f519661b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0c8c22a963e37d7d6db6418",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "杏目",
      "source_fingerprint": "b632be927b5d52ab85b0cfae236cdc76e44b41d48ba6e925027a4013417d1d5f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c05257a28f648b2aee3fb0f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我也不知道有什么方法。\n就我而言确实不知道。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd52e8b7239f2a339258a581d09c3f0c00fe4e1b4366616e996d9e312fdd9b26",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
