    {
      "uid": "zhcn:680dc8041aebb6bd1f189319",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "杏目",
      "source_fingerprint": "b632be927b5d52ab85b0cfae236cdc76e44b41d48ba6e925027a4013417d1d5f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1bae68f63a6b7e964a4bb0b0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只要全力去战斗、并且必胜不就行了。\n这样重复8次就好。\n7胜还是8胜根本没区别。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cd58a5e6d6938d9f8d96965f610e36a42ba8c76c508702f11f19b1bcb20cc94",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d93bf2f06ba43990d79462e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她的名字叫杏目。\n是眼眸中寄宿着满溢而出的、足以实现\n任何梦想的可能性的――好胜的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "515ac10f9dcc47aa4e3f41af14fc836fee02ee8af3e456b2a36d252289f8e1b4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87ba000378c47fc44fdc3d5f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我对她即将开辟的未来怀抱着巨大的梦想――\n与她签订了担当契约。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3413a705a9adbd715c1911c6d28692ac6ad635f5b857fda842e307b7e05b017e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c5fe2d11953325cefb77959",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "接着在签约不久后……\n闪耀系列赛的出道战的日子定下来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dedc4a1556a27458f3dfb6f3069a2b1439aa908fcc1a79ac14f898b2007f1aea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bec3d00ba4704d3a7e5a91e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比方说，经典三冠。\n『皐月赏』『日本德比』『菊花赏』\n首位揽下这三冠的是――",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7f510785d2efb911f864132d42fdd0d8be577268eb87333f374777c1d27375b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05ceeb5a1fab35e2ef2ae5f8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "杏目",
      "source_fingerprint": "b632be927b5d52ab85b0cfae236cdc76e44b41d48ba6e925027a4013417d1d5f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129100.json",
