    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a930b3b3e84d172b47b37ba",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她柔软地运用整个身体，\n大步幅地向前奔跑。\n更厉害的是，她在决胜时刻的惊人爆发力――",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8f5abe674ad36a4ef9061d08168b69cfaaa1f8e2a2c75b2124411e9cbf4fb94",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
