    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b872f480ac3742efc3ac0533",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "圣烈特。\n她的记录成为了一个标杆――\n为比赛界树立了新的目标。",
      "source_fingerprint": "430e4c1464d30e1cca701a6ca12b3c586878ef73a1e860247b37543d438aff4e",
