      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "仿佛毫无极限一般，\n不断地加速、无止境地延伸……。\n她拥有极其锐利的末脚。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f72e38fe36880d47d4bdf8006be65f263b686a83802340e078925b4f4de07a1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
